      "path": "/api/v1/auth/login",
      "method": "POST",
      "summary": "Authenticate with API key and receive HttpOnly session cookie",
      "description": "Validates API key credentials and creates an authenticated session. Returns a signed HttpOnly session cookie for subsequent requests. The session is validated against FIREAI_SESSION_SECRET (minimum 43 chars / 256 bits of entropy). On failure, returns 401 with a generic error message to prevent user enumeration.",
